    "scenesThatPass": [
      "JOHN: No indeed, Mama.\nJANE: You did, you know you did. You knocked me down and cut my head and made it bleed!\nJOHN: I did not!\nJANE: You did! You did! You did!",
      "JANE: Bessie.\nBESSIE: Yes, Jane?\nJANE: I never dreamt I'd get away from here till I was quite grown up.\nBESSIE: Won't you even be sorry to leave your poor old Bessie?",
      "JANE: Me? Oh no thanks, I don't ever take wine.\nJOHN: Anyone here by the name of Eyre?\nJANE: Yes. I'm Miss Eyre. Are you from Thornfield?\nJOHN: You're not the new governess, are you?",
      "THE HALL: Jane enters.\nLEAH: I'll tell Mrs. Fairfax you're here.\nHALL: Jane suddenly hears footsteps echoing back along the stone corridor and prepares to give a good impression to her employer.",
      "JANE: baffled by the discovery.\nADELE: Mademoiselle!"
    ]
